{"metadata":{"title":"samSelectDetailRegion","modules":[{"name":"DotFaceLite"}],"roleHeading":"Function","externalID":"c:@F@samSelectDetailRegion","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"samSelectDetailRegion","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"samSelectDetailRegion","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"func"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@sam_color_image","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite\/sam_color_image","text":"SamColorImage"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:I","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"selectedBoundingBox"},{"kind":"text","text":");"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0 on success, or a non-zero error code on failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analyzes the input image and identifies the most suitable 200x200 pixel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"region (bounding box) with high level of details that intersects a given bounding box."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"type":"text","text":" is empty (width or height is 0), any region can be selected. Otherwise,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the selected region should have non-empty intersection with this bounding box. The selected region"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should lie fully inside the input image."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is no region satisfying these conditions - if image width or height is smaller than 200"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"type":"text","text":" lies outside the image, the selected bounding box will be (0, 0, 200, 200)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["                                  a bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height)."],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"code":["                                  return, contains the bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height),","                                  where width and height are always set to 200."],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/dotfacelite\/samselectdetailregion"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite\/samSelectDetailRegion","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"doc://DotFaceLite/documentation/DotFaceLite":{"abstract":[{"text":"version: 9.9.0","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"DotFaceLite","url":"\/documentation\/dotfacelite","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite"},"doc://DotFaceLite/documentation/DotFaceLite/sam_color_image":{"title":"sam_color_image","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments"